Sequential work where each task blocks the next. Middle nodes carry
*both* `dependsOn: <prev>` and `dependents: N` lenses:

- [ ] specify the API <!-- @id:m9d1 -->
- [ ] implement the API <!-- @id:m9d2 @dependsOn:m9d1 -->
- [ ] test the API <!-- @id:m9d3 @dependsOn:m9d2 -->

